Z||000000||dcaprio||10-28-2001||06:34 AM||||  I bought a 4 cylinder Fiero with a starting problem so I thought it would be a good quiz for all of you. HINT a very easy fix and not a blown fuse.<BR>  Car will only start with starter fluid shot down the throttle body, then will run fine till it's turned off. Then you have to use the starter fluid to restart ,even if only a few seconds have passed.<BR>  A few of you that know me, know the answer so don't give it away. Good luck , it only took me 5 minutes to find what was wrong and anouther 2 minutes to get it to start on it's own. ||||reg||1
